hi-064-suncong-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p011:m0360","surface":"幹","start":360,"end":361,"kind":"person","person_id":"cyq_b4j_4k0","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p011","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-xiu:p002","text":"永安元年冬十月壬午，詔曰：「夫襃德賞功，古今通義。其以大將軍綝爲丞相、荊州牧，增食五縣。武衞將軍恩爲御史大夫、衞將軍、中軍督，封縣侯。威遠將軍授爲右將軍、縣侯。偏將軍幹雜號將軍、亭侯。長水校尉張布輔導勤勞，以布爲輔義將軍，封永康侯。董朝親迎，封爲鄉侯。」又詔曰：「丹陽太守李衡，以往事之嫌，自拘有司。夫射鉤斬袪，在君爲君，遣衡還郡，勿令自疑。」己丑，封孫皓爲烏程侯，皓弟德錢唐侯，謙永安侯。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":35,"last_line":35,"raw_start":3033,"raw_end":3945,"raw_character_offsets":[3045,3046,3047,3048,3056,3057,3058,3059,3060,3061,3062,3063,3064,3065,3072,3073,3074,3075,3076,3077,3078,3079,3080,3081,3082,3083,3084,3085,3086,3087,3088,3089,3090,3091,3092,3093,3094,3095,3096,3097,3098,3099,3100,3101,3102,3103,3104,3105,3106,3107,3108,3109,3110,3111,3112,3113,3114,3115,3116,3117,3118,3119,3120,3121,3122,3123,3124,3125,3126,3127,3128,3129,3130,3131,3132,3133,3134,3135,3136,3137,3138,3139,3140,3141,3142,3143,3144,3145,3146,3147,3148,3149,3150,3151,3152,3153,3154,3155,3156,3157,3158,3159,3160,3161,3162,3163,3164,3165,3166,3167,3168,3169,3170,3171,3172,3173,3174,3175,3176,3177,3178,3179,3180,3181,3182,3183,3186,3187,3188,3189,3190,3191,3198,3199,3200,3201,3202,3203,3204,3205,3206,3207,3208,3209,3210,3211,3212,3213,3214,3215,3216,3217,3218,3219,3220,3221,3222,3223,3224,3225,3226,3227,3228,3229,3230,3231,3232,3233,3234,3235,3236,3239,3834,3835,3836,3837,3838,3839,3840,3841,3842,3843,3844,3845,3846,3847,3848,3849,3850,3851,3852,3853,3854,3855,3856],"revision_id":2085142},"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-xiu:p002:m0030","